                        "description": "**Cross-domain: Policy → Tourism**\n\nFind which attractions are most relevant to visa policies.\n\n**Use Case:**\n- Recommend attractions based on visitor's visa type\n- Understand policy impact on tourism destinations\n\n**Demo Points:**\n- Connects government policy domain with tourism domain\n- Enables policy-aware travel recommendations"
                    },
