            ],
            "description": "★ MAIN DEMO: Cross-type predictions showcase heterogeneous GNN power"
        },
        {
            "name": "6. Hybrid Reasoning (Advanced)",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Hybrid Itinerary: Colombo → Kandy",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"start_location\": \"Colombo\",\n  \"end_location\": \"Kandy\",\n  \"interests\": [\"history\", \"culture\"],\n  \"min_rating\": 4.0\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/research/hybrid/reason",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "research",
                                "hybrid",
                                "reason"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "**Advanced: Hybrid Symbolic-Neural Reasoning**\n\nCombines:\n- **Symbolic:** Rule-based reasoning, explicit knowledge\n- **Neural:** GNN embeddings, learned patterns\n\n**Expected Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"itinerary\": [\n    {\"attraction\": \"Temple of the Tooth\", \"confidence\": 0.92},\n    {\"attraction\": \"Royal Botanical Gardens\", \"confidence\": 0.87}\n  ],\n  \"start\": \"Colombo\",\n  \"end\": \"Kandy\",\n  \"overall_confidence\": 0.89,\n  \"symbolic_confidence\": 0.85,\n  \"neural_confidence\": 0.93,\n  \"explanation\": {\n    \"symbolic_reasoning\": \"Rule-based filtering\",\n    \"neural_reasoning\": \"GNN similarity scores\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Demo Points:**\n- ✅ Best of both worlds: rules + learning\n- ✅ Interpretable (symbolic) + powerful (neural)\n- ✅ 60% symbolic weight + 40% neural weight"
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ],
            "description": "Advanced hybrid reasoning combining symbolic and neural approaches"
        }
